    Artfight attack of Umjetnost Farbić from DiptronicXLX. Umjetnost is a pink fox-cat-dragon hybrid with very thick fur, as can be evidenced by the tail. Color also has long light pink hair and rainbow coloured eyes, with star shaped pupils. Color is seen here winking at the viewer, and blushing. The blush is also rainbow coloured. Color is wearing a plain green dress. Diptronic's signature is down by the right paw.
